{"id":"word:hebrew:H3063","type":"word","title":"יְהוּדָה","subtitle":"H3063 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"Jehudah (or Judah), the name of five Israelites; also of the tribe descended from the first, and of its territory","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to יְהוּדָה (H3063) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-pr-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 819 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"יְהוּדָה (Yᵉhûwdâh) means Jehudah (or Judah), the name of five Israelites; also of the tribe descended from the first, and of its territory First listed occurrence: 1Chr 2 1."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"יְהוּדָה","transliteration":"Yᵉhûwdâh","pronunciation":"yeh-hoo-daw'","strong":"H3063","lemmaId":"hebrew:H3063","partOfSpeech":"n-pr-m","forms":["יְהוּדָ֔ה","יְהוּדָ֑ה","יְהוּדָ֖ה","יְהוּדָֽה","יְהוּדָה֙"],"morphs":[["HNp",682],["HR/Np",90],["HC/Np",39],["HC/R/Np",8]]},"definitions":{"short":"Jehudah (or Judah), the name of five Israelites; also of the tribe descended from the first, and of its territory","usage":"Judah.","full":"H3063. Yehudah יְהוּדָה 820 proper name, masculine and of a territory Judah (treated Gen 29:35 ; 49:8 (q. v. below) as if derived from Hoph`al of ידה = praised, object of praise (on ה compare Hiph`il אֲהוֺדֶ֑נּוּ Psa 28:7 , יְהוֺדֶה Neh 11:17 ), but this dubious; relation to יְהֻד , II. יְהוּדִית : unexplained; see further Jastr JBL xii, 1898, 61 ff. ; Assyrian Ia-u-du, of land; Ia-u-da-ai, Judaean COT Gloss ) — I. proper name, masculine 1. son of Jacob and Leah , explained by Leah's words I will praise ׳י Gen 29:35 (J); compare Jacob's prediction, thy brethren shall praise thee 49:8 (poem in J E), see also 49:9 ; 49:10 ; elsewhere 37:26 ; 38:1 14 t. Genesis 38; 43:3 , 8 ; 44:14 , 16 , 18 ; 46:28 (all J), 35:23 (P), 1Chr 2:1 , 3 ; Ruth 4:12 ; יְהוּדָה בְּנֵי sons of Judah Gen 46:12 ; Num 26:19 (P), 1Chr 2:3-4 , 4:1 . 2 tribe descended from Judah Deut 33:7 (poem), Num 1:7 (P), Deut 27:12 +; יהודה בְּנֵי Num 1:26 ; Josh 14:6 (D), Judg 1:8 +; יהודה שֵׁבֶט Josh 7:16 (J), 1Kin 12:20 ; 2Kin 17:18 ; Psa 78:68 ; יהודה בְנֵי מַטֵּה Josh 15:1 , 20 , 21 ; 21:9 (all P), 1Chr 6:50 ; elsewhere יהודה מַטֵּה Exod 31:2 ; 35:30 ; 38:22 ; Num 1:27 ; 7:12 ; 13:6 ; 34:19 ; Josh 7:1 , 18 ; 21:4 (all P); יהודה אישׁ Judg 15:20 +; יהודה אנשׁי 2Sam 2:4 +, (compare amelûti [ƒabê] Ia-u-du Tel el-Amarna No. 39 Jastr JBL xii, 1893, 64 ). 3 nation , of southern kingdom under dynasty of David, as distinguished from northern kingdom of Ephraim or Israel: Hosea 4:15 ; Jer 2:28 ; 2Chr 12:12 +; of the returned exiles Neh 4:4 ; יהודה עַם 2Kin 14:21 2Chr 26:1 ; Jer 25:1-2 , Ezra 4:4 ; יהודה בְּנֵי Hosea 2:2 ; Jer 7:30 ; 2Chr 13:18 ; 25:12 ; 28:10 ; יהודה בֵּית Hosea 1:7 ; Jer 3:18 ; Ezek 4:6 +; יהודה מַלְכוּת 2Chr 11:17 ; personified, י ׳בַּת Lam 1:15 ; 2:2 , 5 . 4 Levite, Ezra's time , Ezra 10:23 . 5 an over-seer of Jerusalem Neh 11:9 . 6 Levite musician Neh 12:8 . 7 priest Neh 12:36 . II. proper name, of a territory land of Judah , feminine Isa 7:6 ; Jer 23:6 = 33:16 ; Joel 4:30; Psa 114:2 +; יְהוּדָה ארץ 1Sam 22:5 ; 2Kin 23:24 +; יהודה אדמת Isa 19:17 ; יהודה עָרֵי 2Sam 2:1 ; 1Kin 12:17 ; 2Kin 18:13 ; 23:5 , 8 ; Isa 40:9 ; 44:26 ; Zech 1:12 ; Psa 69:36 ; Lam 5:11 ; elsewhere 15 t. Chronicles, 23 t. Jeremiah; בִּיהודה Judg 15:9 +; מיהודה 1Kin 13:1 +; יהודה הר the hill-country of Judah Josh 11:21 (D), 20:7 ; 21:11 (P), 2Chr 27:4 ; יהודה נֶגֶב the south ( country ) of Judah 1Sam 27:10 ; 2Sam 24:7 ; יהודה מדבר Judg 1:16 ; Psa 63:1 (title).","rootNote":"from 3034 ; celebrated ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 2 1","keyReferences":["1Chr 2 1","1Chr 2 3","1Chr 2 3","1Chr 2 4","1Chr 2 10","1Chr 4 1","1Chr 4 21","1Chr 4 27"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":819,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 2 1","book":"1Chr","chapt